---- MODULE space_equal__tuple_prime__no_deadlock_check ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0 /\ y = 0
Next == <<x, y>>' = <<x, y>>

====

